<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Too Loud. Too Fast. - Hot Wheels Collection</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Aptos:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Aptos', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background-color: #003d99;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.3);
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #1e90ff;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #003d99 0%, #1e90ff 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            animation: slideIn 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .cta-button {
            background-color: white;
            color: #003d99;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        /* Stats Section */
        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.1);
            border-top: 4px solid #003d99;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.2);
        }

        .stat-card h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #003d99;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-card p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Featured Car Section */
        .featured {
            background-color: #e6f0ff;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid #003d99;
        }

        .featured h2 {
            color: #003d99;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .featured-car {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .featured-image {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 4rem;
        }

        .featured-details h3 {
            color: #003d99;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .featured-details p {
            color: #555;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Search & Filter */
        .search-section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.1);
        }

        .search-section h2 {
            color: #003d99;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .search-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        input, select {
            padding: 0.8rem;
            border: 2px solid #003d99;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: 'Aptos', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #1e90ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(30, 144, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* Collection Grid */
        .collection {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .collection h2 {
            color: #003d99;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .car-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border-top: 3px solid #003d99;
        }

        .car-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 61, 153, 0.2);
        }

        .car-image {
            background-color: #e6f0ff;
            height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #003d99;
        }

        .car-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .car-info h3 {
            color: #003d99;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .car-details {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #003d99;
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about {
            background-color: #e6f0ff;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about h2 {
            color: #003d99;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #003d99;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        footer p {
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .social-links {
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .social-links a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            color: #1e90ff;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            nav ul {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .featured-car {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#collection">Collection</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Too Loud. Too Fast.</h1>
        <p>Welcome to My Hot Wheels Collection</p>
        <button class="cta-button">Explore Collection</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats Section -->
    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>1,250+</h3>
            <p>Cars Collected</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>45+</h3>
            <p>Series</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
            <h3>85%</h3>
            <p>Mint Condition</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Featured Car -->
    <div class="featured">
        <h2>⭐ Featured Car of the Week</h2>
        <div class="featured-car">
            <div class="featured-image">🏎️</div>
            <div class="featured-details">
                <h3>1970 Plymouth Roadrunner</h3>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Red</p>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Mint</p>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Classic Collection</p>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Common</p>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Year Acquired:</span> 2022</p>
                <p><span class="detail-label">Notes:</span> This was my first car in the collection. Perfect condition with original packaging!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Search & Filter -->
    <div class="search-section">
        <h2>🔍 Search & Filter</h2>
        <div class="search-container">
            <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search by car name...">
            <select id="filterSeries">
                <option value="">All Series</option>
                <option value="Classic">Classic</option>
                <option value="Modern">Modern</option>
                <option value="Sports">Sports</option>
                <option value="Vintage">Vintage Racers</option>
            </select>
            <select id="filterCondition">
                <option value="">All Conditions</option>
                <option value="Mint">Mint</option>
                <option value="Excellent">Excellent</option>
                <option value="Good">Good</option>
                <option value="Used">Used</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Collection -->
    <div class="collection" id="collection">
        <h2>My Collection</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">🏎️</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>1970 Plymouth Roadrunner</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Red</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Mint</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Classic</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Common</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">🏁</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>Bugatti Veyron</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Yellow</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Mint</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Modern</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Uncommon</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">⚡</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>Ferrari Testarossa</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Black</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Used</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Classic</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Rare</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">💨</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>Lamborghini Countach</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> White</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Good</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Modern</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Very Rare</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">🚗</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>Porsche 911</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Silver</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Mint</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Sports</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Common</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="car-card">
                <div class="car-image">🏆</div>
                <div class="car-info">
                    <h3>Ford Mustang</h3>
                    <div class="car-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Color:</span> Blue</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Condition:</span> Used</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Series:</span> Classic</div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">Rarity:</span> Uncommon</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <div class="about" id="about">
        <div class="about-container">
            <h2>About My Collection</h2>
            <p>Welcome to "Too Loud. Too Fast." - My personal Hot Wheels collection showcase! I've been collecting these amazing die-cast vehicles for over a decade, and my passion for them grows stronger every day.</p>
            <p>My collection features over 1,250 rare and classic Hot Wheels from various series spanning multiple decades. Each car has its own story, from lucky finds at estate sales to strategic trades with fellow collectors.</p>
            <p>This site is dedicated to showcasing my passion for these incredible miniature vehicles. Whether you're a seasoned collector or just starting your journey, I hope you enjoy browsing through my collection as much as I enjoy collecting them!</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer id="contact">
        <p>&copy; 2024 Too Loud. Too Fast. - Hot Wheels Collection</p>
        <p>Michael Di Terlizzi</p>
        <div class="social-links">
            <a href="#">Instagram</a>
            <a href="#">Twitter</a>
            <a href="#">Email</a>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Simple search functionality
        document.getElementById('searchInput').addEventListener('keyup', function() {
            const searchTerm = this.value.toLowerCase();
            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.car-card');
            cards.forEach(card => {
                const carName = card.querySelector('h3').textContent.toLowerCase();
                card.style.display = carName.includes(searchTerm) ? 'block' : 'none';
            });
        });

        // CTA Button
        document.querySelector('.cta-button').addEventListener('click', function() {
            document.getElementById('collection').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
